File Index

/action.ts
Purpose: Defines the action interface and types for game token interactions.

/army.ts
Purpose: Defines the structure and metadata for a military force in a strategic game match.

/board.ts
Purpose: Defines the data structures for game board tiles, terrain features, and board layout.

/coord.ts
Purpose: Defines coordinate system and player indexing for board games.

/index.ts
Purpose: Exports all domain types for the Kingdom Tactics game engine.

/match.ts
Purpose: Defines the data structures and interfaces for representing match state and moon context in a board game engine.

/mode.ts
Purpose: Defines the structure and properties of game modes including their rules, scale, and victory conditions.

/squadron.ts
Purpose: Defines squadron data structures for aggregate unit management in battle-scale gameplay.

/unit.ts
Purpose: Defines unit templates and instances for combat and movement mechanics.
